product details

Introducing the Apple 1:1 AirPods Pro ANC, an exceptional audio companion that mirrors the renowned quality and innovation of Apple's AirPods Pro. These earbuds are meticulously crafted to offer an immersive listening experience, featuring cutting-edge Active Noise Cancellation (ANC) technology for a premium audio journey.

With a design that closely emulates the iconic AirPods Pro, the 1:1 version combines seamless connectivity, superior sound quality, and a comfortable fit. Enjoy the freedom of wireless audio with the convenience of Apple's proprietary H1 chip, ensuring instant pairing and a stable connection for an unparalleled user experience.

The 1:1 AirPods Pro ANC replicate the original's industry-leading Active Noise Cancellation technology, allowing you to immerse yourself in your music without being disturbed by external noise. Whether you're in a bustling city or traveling, the ANC feature adapts to your environment, creating a cocoon of sound that enhances your audio enjoyment.

features:

Apple 1:1 Airpods Pro 2 ANC

1. Real Active Noise Cancellation (ANC)

2. Support wireless charging;

3. In-ear Detection Smart Sensor;

4. Support pop-up window(IOS), open the lid

5. Accurate Battery;

6. Upgrade the Bluetooth 5.0 chip, the performance is improved, 10 meters is not stuck & continuous;

8. Squeeze sensor;

9. Call to listen to songs for 3+ hours, long battery life;

10. Out of the box automatic boot / automatic pairing;

